  unitName: Dark Nymph
  unitId: 60120
  unitNumber: 176
  description: A small fairy thought to be born from dark, one of the six elements
    made by the gods.It's an annoying, angry creature that preaches constantly. It's
    not very intelligent, so its wide-ranging sermons are superficial. It adds "pune"
    as a suffix when it thinks something is good. Summoners look for it to have the
    ability to grant special powers to other beings.
  summonDesc: I am a Dark Nymph-pune!<br>You are really interesting.<br>That's it!
    I will go with you-pune.
